Package: echoverse
Title: Client for the EPA ECHO and Envirofacts Web Services
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sean", "Thimons", email = "thimons.sean@gmail.com",
        role = c('aut', 'cre'))
Description: Generated client for the U.S. EPA Enforcement and Compliance
    History Online (ECHO) web service APIs and the Envirofacts (DMAP) data
    tables (26 APIs, 995 operations),
    built with specmill from local Swagger and OpenAPI schemas.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: httr2, jsonlite, curl, tibble
Suggests: testthat, sf
